flowchart TD
  Browse[Select organizer and event] --> Rules[Read rules fee and requirements]
  Rules --> Login[Verify student identity and college profile]
  Login --> Mode{Approved registration mode}
  Mode -->|Team| Consent[Valid roster and member consent]
  Mode -->|Individual policy approved| Solo[Individual intake]
  Consent --> Capacity{Capacity available}
  Solo --> Capacity
  Capacity -->|No| Waitlist[Waitlist without payment]
  Capacity -->|Yes| Hold[Atomic reservation and fee snapshot]
  Hold --> Pay[Pay verified official college destination]
  Pay --> Evidence[Submit payment evidence]
  Evidence --> Review{Finance matches actual credit}
  Review -->|Needs correction| Correct[Action required]
  Correct --> Evidence
  Review -->|Verified| Eligible{Roster and eligibility ready}
  Eligible -->|No| Allocation[Resolve allocation or exception]
  Allocation --> Eligible
  Eligible -->|Yes| Confirm[Confirm registration and issue member passes]
  Confirm --> Scan[On duty volunteer scans]
  Scan --> Check{Server validates scope pass and uniqueness}
  Check -->|Valid first use| Recorded[Attendance recorded]
  Check -->|Duplicate| Duplicate[Already checked in]
  Check -->|Invalid or offline| Denied[Not recorded and supervised resolution]
